WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.790
Someone's just tried your product.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.670
What would you like them to do next?

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.468
At a tasting, that could be

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.690
a conversation with your host.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.328
At a photo set, it's the picture

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.370
they take home with them.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.688
We start there, then work back

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.230
through the layout, the staff,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.510
and what the venue allows.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.528
Before the build, the brand and
organizer

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.048
agree on what goes in the room

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.410
and what gets captured.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.108
Tell us who you want to reach

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.940
and what you'd like them to remember.
